MultiKeys 0008: HID channel isolation and rescue/OTP/RNG hardening.
- src/usb/hid/hid.c: packets from other channels never touch shared buffers while a job runs; responses use
  the job's channel, WINK does not sleep, channel ids are random.
- src/rescue.c: presence wait honours EV_EXIT, PHY write is parsed into a scratch record and must keep the
  application interface, SET TIME needs presence, unknown P1 rejected.
- src/otp/otp_esp32.c: upstream secure-boot burn removed; MKEK locking only after a successful write.
- src/rng: repetition-count test, consumed pool bytes zeroed, random_bytes_get serialised.

